<title>FRANCE: PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - July 15.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - July 15.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Algerian press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>EL MOUDJAHID</p>
<p>- The security situation suddenly worsened reaching its height yesterady with the massacre of civilians in Medea, south of Algiers, and the bomb blast in Baraki, Algiers's southern district.</p>
<p>EL WATAN</p>
<p>- Bomb exploded in Baraki's market on Monday killing 26 people and wounding 83.</p>
<p>LE MATIN</p>
<p>- &quot;Terrorists&quot; kill 15 people in Medea province.</p>
<p>EL ACIL</p>
<p>- The authorities record registered local trade with the aim of streamlining commerce.</p>
